        <mxCell id="gBJMQ7MSPqtio1fBqTaR-45" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;fontFamily=Cascadia Mono;" value="10.244.1.3:1234 --&amp;gt; 10.69.1.7:443&lt;div&gt;10.69.1.7:443 是ClusterIP，&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;后端为 10.244.2.5:443&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;位于其他Node&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="410" x="-390" y="-117" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gBJMQ7MSPqtio1fBqTaR-46" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;fontFamily=Cascadia Mono;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="如果目的端是ClusterIP, 则替换为POD 信息&lt;div&gt;10.244.1.3:1234 --&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;10.244.2.5:443&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="56" width="260" x="250" y="-43" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gBJMQ7MSPqtio1fBqTaR-47" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;fontFamily=Cascadia Mono;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="cil_from_container：&lt;div&gt;1. tuple(dst:10.244.2.5 src:10.244.1.3 dport:1234 sport:443 TUPLE_F_IN) 查CT表，结果是new&lt;div&gt;2. 因scope为bidir, swap后以&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;tuple(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;dst:10.244.1.3 src:10.244.2.5 dport:443 sport:1234 TUPLE_F_OUT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;) 查CT表，结果仍是new&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3. 检查policy, 通过后&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;以&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;tuple(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;dst:10.244.1.3 src:10.244.2.5 dport:443 sport:1234 TUPLE_F_OUT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;为key,创建CT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4. 调用 bpf_redirect_neigh转发&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="157" width="390" x="320" y="143" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
