        <mxCell id="33JHD12F42hqdb621soH-5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;fontFamily=Cascadia Mono;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="cil_from_netdev：&lt;div&gt;1. 目的信息不是NodePort，也不匹配snat表,则进入tail_handle_ipv4_cont_from_netdev&lt;div&gt;2. 继续调用&amp;nbsp;ipv4_local_delivery（入方向限速）--&amp;gt; cil_lxc_policy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;tuple(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;dst:10.244.2.5 src:10.244.1.3 dport:1234 sport:443 TUPLE_F_OUT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;)查CT表，结果是New&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;因scope为bidir, swap后以&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;tuple(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;dst:10.244.1.3 src:10.244.2.5 dport:443 sport:1234 TUPLE_F_IN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;) 查CT表，结果仍是new&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;检查policy, 通过后&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;以&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;tuple(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;dst:10.244.1.3 src:10.244.2.5 dport:443 sport:1234 TUPLE_F_IN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;为key创建CT，并调用bpf_redirect_peer转发&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
